      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This would also allow us to feed the SFES to quest avatars too which would allow us to give them a closer event inclusion experience to what we give PC users, even without Audiolink, I'd like to add the request that this would be modifiable with tiling and offset, and maskable like an emission colour",
